  "description": "Sherry FitzGerald are delighted to bring to the lettings market this substantial 2 bed apartment in New Priory. Located in this newly redeveloped complex, there are a whole host of local amenities to be found. Tesco Clarehall and Donaghmede Shopping Centre are both just moments away, and there are a number of excellent national and secondary schools to be found within easy reach of this wonderful property. Dublin Airport is also just a short drive away and the city centre is easily accessed via the number of bus routes serving the area. The M1 and M50 provide excellent access to all parts of the country. You can be sure that the owners have decorated it to an extremely high standard throughout. The apartment boasts a large open plan living / dining room, off which is a modern fitted kitchen. There are two double bedrooms to be found and the master bedroom boasts it's own en-suite bathroom. There is also a main bathroom and the property includes a parking space. Offered for letting fully furnished and complete with all essential modern conveniences, this lovely apartment is available now. Please contact us today to register your interest!",
